Giant serpents live in a cavern deep below [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], in a wild cave where purple crystals on the ceiling cast a bluish glow and small creatures live in the pools. Algae grows in their water. They speak, and they keep watch on whoever enters their cavern.

They rise half out of the water to demand who a visitor is and whether they are allowed to be there. They ask to see a permission slip, and will try to eat it. Those they do not know, they judge not allowed, and attack.

At least four still live in the pools. Two others are dead.
